  "unit_verified_mechanisms": [
    "Defaults preserve four browser choices, separate-profile/bookmark opt-in and history/cookie opt-out. No category is newly required; all data flags may remain off.",
    "Latest-only debounce tokens dispatch a visible selection once; cancelled, hidden, duplicate and superseded tokens do not start a read. Callback-free UI option changes request a rescan.",
    "Unready/busy preview dispatch waits and exposes event-driven resume only after configuration is available; hidden/cancelled waits cannot resume.",
    "Scanning keeps options/close editable; submitted/applying work locks them. Apply requires a matching preview, visible panel and available configuration/profile state. Invalid browser indices and inconsistent busy/can-apply flags remain safe.",
    "Duplicate Apply requests reject; immediate rejection can retry. Service feedback/progress/completion is authoritative and synchronous completion cannot be overwritten by a later admission return.",
    "External preview-option snapshots cannot enable Apply for different visible UI choices; service authorization/read errors can unlock controls and preserve retry feedback."
